<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλῐγωρ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>an
				esteeming lightly, contempt,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό τε ὕβριος καὶ -ίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.106
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.137
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὀλιγωρίᾳ ποιεῖσθαι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλιγωρεῖν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.5
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ὀλιγωρίαν τραπέσθαι τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.52
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					54.39
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					11.9.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1378b10
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1315a18
				</span></i>
			 : in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				7.51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>neglect of duty, negligence,</i> Decret. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.74
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακεχυμέναι πρὸς -ίαν διατριβαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>Hist.</u>
					p.257
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i></div>
